{"kind":"reasoning","id":"p5-2f930857","text":"Now read the paywall mockup code.html and maybe the screen png to understand current mockup. Also need to see how the current paywall looks (the mockup). And need to check the plan doc for task 22, since I need to record changes in the task file. Let me check docs/tasks/22*.md and 00_INDEX current phase.

