eight cap and scroll; three-action grouping; red destructive action; returned answers and handlers; a 2.0x text step) and a new narrow Exit case in `app_shell_exit_test.dart` (360 px stacks the pair full width). `flutter analyze` clean; full `flutter test` **2,196 passed**. The remaining windows migrate in later waves; no mockup draws a centred window, so none changed (rule 9).
